      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:7:1:5:4",
      "text": [
        " سَأَلْتُ أَبَا عَبْدِ اللَّهِ ( عليه السلام ) عَنِ الْوَصِيَّةِ لِلْوَارِثِ فَقَالَ تَجُوزُ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Muhammad Bin Yahya, from Ahmad Bin Muhammad, from Al Hassan Bin Ali, from Abdullah Bin Bakeyr, from Muhammad Bin Muslim who said, ",
          "‘I asked Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> about the bequest for the inheritors, so he<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘Permissible’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "4. Muhammad ibn Yahya has narrated from Ahmad ibn Muhammad from al-Hassan ibn Ali from ‘Abd Allah ibn Bukayr from Muhammad ibn Muslim who has narrated the following: “I once asked abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, about making a will for the heir. He (the Imam) said, ‘It is permissible.’” "
        ]
      }
    },
